/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This study aims to create and evaluate a web-based Research Monitoring System with Data Analytics for PUP Unisan. The system will help students and advisers monitor tasks more easily, improve communication, and ensure accurate and organized documentation. It also supports quality education and promotes efficient, transparent, and technology-based research processes.)
/E (This study aims to create and evaluate a web-based Research Monitoring System with Data Analytics for PUP Unisan. The system will help students and advisers monitor tasks more easily, improve communication, and ensure accurate and organized documentation. It also supports quality education and promotes efficient, transparent, and technology-based research processes.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
