/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This chapter delves deeply into what is already proven about research monitoring. It focuses on the existing literature and studies that have a direct correlation to the development of Research Monitoring System with Data Analytics. It examines the current trends, issues, and theoretical foundation relative to research monitoring and information systems. The chapter identifies gaps of previous works and establishes the basis for designing a system suited to the needs of PUP Unisan, Quezon Campus.)
/E (This chapter delves deeply into what is already proven about research monitoring. It focuses on the existing literature and studies that have a direct correlation to the development of Research Monitoring System with Data Analytics. It examines the current trends, issues, and theoretical foundation relative to research monitoring and information systems. The chapter identifies gaps of previous works and establishes the basis for designing a system suited to the needs of PUP Unisan, Quezon Campus.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
