/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (- Research Monitoring System involves evaluating commercial and open-source platforms that help academic institutions, research libraries, and showcase research activities. System monitoring is an important basis for system modelling and improvement. Monitoring and evaluation are essential components of the research process, as they help maintain the quality, integrity, and timely completion of research outputs. Establishing an effective monitoring system is crucial for strengthening research governance \(Enciso, 2024\).)
/E (- Research Monitoring System involves evaluating commercial and open-source platforms that help academic institutions, research libraries, and showcase research activities. System monitoring is an important basis for system modelling and improvement. Monitoring and evaluation are essential components of the research process, as they help maintain the quality, integrity, and timely completion of research outputs. Establishing an effective monitoring system is crucial for strengthening research governance \(Enciso, 2024\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
