265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (- The Research Monitoring System is a prototype for HEIs in the Philippines to improve research management. It has a data input module \(Fig. 1A\) for recording application type, title, publication details, abstract, keywords, and research documents. A second module \(Fig. 1B\) stores author and co-author information and links research outputs to institutional goals. These modules support organized data handling, fast access, evaluation, and tracking. The system is designed to be user-friendly, adaptable, and helpful for decision-making \(Regla & Ballera, 2024\).)
/E (- The Research Monitoring System is a prototype for HEIs in the Philippines to improve research management. It has a data input module \(Fig. 1A\) for recording application type, title, publication details, abstract, keywords, and research documents. A second module \(Fig. 1B\) stores author and co-author information and links research outputs to institutional goals. These modules support organized data handling, fast access, evaluation, and tracking. The system is designed to be user-friendly, adaptable, and helpful for decision-making \(Regla & Ballera, 2024\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
