/T (- This section explains how data analytics can be integrated into a research monitoring software system. By embedding analytics tools directly into the platform, the system can automatically process, analyze, and visualize research data. Through these features, the system can provide real-time insights, tracking research progress, detect irregularities, and generate reports that support data-driven decision-making.)
/E (- This section explains how data analytics can be integrated into a research monitoring software system. By embedding analytics tools directly into the platform, the system can automatically process, analyze, and visualize research data. Through these features, the system can provide real-time insights, tracking research progress, detect irregularities, and generate reports that support data-driven decision-making.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
