/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (RESEARCH DESIGN - The study uses a Developmental Research Design, which involves the systematic process of designing, developing, and evaluating tools or models \(Ramirez, 2023\). This design fits the study because it aims to create an innovative system that addresses gaps in Information Technology. - The process includes analysis, design, development, implementation, and evaluation, ensuring the system is improved based on user needs and feedback. This approach also requires validation using both quantitative and qualitative methods.)
/E (RESEARCH DESIGN - The study uses a Developmental Research Design, which involves the systematic process of designing, developing, and evaluating tools or models \(Ramirez, 2023\). This design fits the study because it aims to create an innovative system that addresses gaps in Information Technology. - The process includes analysis, design, development, implementation, and evaluation, ensuring the system is improved based on user needs and feedback. This approach also requires validation using both quantitative and qualitative methods.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
